<p>Your mere presence is terrying to any foes that dare stand against you.</p><p>Every turn all foes in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 5, 7, 8, 9</acronym> must make a mental save against your spellpower/physical power (whichever is highest) or become frightened (bypassing fear immunity), reducing all their saves by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 21, 28, 35, 40,</acronym> all damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 16%, 19%, 23%, 25%</acronym> and movement speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 16%, 21%, 24%, 27%.</acronym></p><p>If they successfully resist, they are immune for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">19, 15, 13, 12, 11</acronym> turns.</p>